<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal govt,Sonae to sign Torralta deal.</title>
<headline>Portugal govt,Sonae to sign Torralta deal.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail group Sonae and the Portuguese government will sign an agreement later on Wednesday on the sale of tourism operator Torralta, the Economy Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>Details of the plan were not available but Sonae is expected to buy the loss-making company, which runs the Troia tourist complex south of Lisbon, and take over its debts to the state.</p>
<p>The signing ceremony was due to take place at 1800 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
